                     G E T T I N G       S T A R T E D    

Follow the 6 Steps to Generate and Print your Bills.
----------------------------------------------------

STEP 1. CREATION OF A NEW SOCIETY.
----------------------------------
A New Society can be created at any stage by Selecting the Option
<CREATE COMPANY>
1. Press Enter when prompted to enter Company No.
2. Enter the Society Name when prompted Company Name
3. Select the option Create Company, and press Enter Key.
4. When you are prompted <PRESS ENTER KEY TO PROCESS>, press the Enter Key
   a group of files will be copied.
5. Use the <SHIFT TO> to select the Newly created Society.   

                 
STEP 2. INSTALLATION 
--------------------
When you select a newly created Society, you will be prompted to enter the password.
Since no Password is set yet, simply press the Enter Key, whenever prompted to 
enter the password.

Next you will be prompted to Install the Package, When prompted,
Install the Package ? enter "Y" for Yes.
You will be prompted to enter the Codeword. Enter "james" in lower or UPPER case.

Enter the SOCIETY NAME when prompted to do so.
Enter the ACCOUNTING PERIOD 
You may leave the Address and other infomation blank.

STEP 3. CREATING LEDGER ACCOUNTS
--------------------------------
Next take your list of members of the society, and start entering all the member names.
As shown below select the Menu Master Maint. อออ Create Account

     ษอออ  MAIN  MENU  ออป      ษอออ MASTER MAINT. อป              
     บ 0. Quit           บ      บ 0. Quit           บ 
     บ 1. Master Maint.  บ อออ บ 1. Create Account บ 
     บ 2. Voucher Entry  บ      บ 2. Edit Account   บ 
     บ 3. Bills/Vouchers บ      บ 3. Member Details บ


e.g. Enter the Name Rajesh Shah, (as Ledger Account)
     Next a list of GROUPS will pop up,
     
     Select the Group  <MEMBER'S DUES>, and press Enter Key.
     You may enter the Opening Balance, or do so later on.
     Press Enter to <SAVE> or Delete if entered wrongly.
     
     Go on entering all the names of members, one by one, now the
     Group <MEMBER'S DUES> will be selected Automatically.
     Do not enter the Title Mr. or Mrs. alongwith the names, there is a special
     provision for it.
     
     After entering all the member name, come out from the screen,
     by either pressing <ESC> key, or saying <NO> for any More Entries ? 
     
     Next take a copy of the Society Bill
     ------------------------------------
     Go to the same Menu once again, of <CREATE ACCOUNT>     
     Now you have to create all the Ledger Accounts of the Bill Items
     
     e.g.
     
     Ledger Account           Select Group
     --------------------------------------
     PROPERTY TAXES            Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS > - Income & Exp. Item
     WATER CHARGES COLLECTION  Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS >
     SERVICE CHARGES           Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS >
     PARKING CHARGES           Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS >
     SINKING FUND              Select Group < SINKING FUND > - since its a Liability item.
     CABLE TV CHARGES          Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS >
     NON OCCUPANTY CHARGES     Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS >
     REPAIR FUND               Select Group < OTHER FUNDS > - since its a Liability item.
     INTEREST ON ARREARS       Select Group < CONTRIBUTION FROM MEMBERS > or < INCOME >
     
     You may continue further by creating all Ledger Accounts from the Balance Sheet 
     and from the Income & Expenditure Statement of the Previous Year.
     
     e.g. Take your previous Years Income & Expenditure Statement
     ------------------------------------------------------------
     CONVEYANCE                  Select Group < EXPENSES > - since it is an Expense
     MUNCIPAL TAX                Select Group < EXPENSES > 
     WATER CHARGES PAID          Select Group < EXPENSES > 
     PRINTING & STATIONERY       Select Group < EXPENSES > 
     
     enter the rest of the Expense items similarly
     
     Next Take your Previous Years Balance Sheet
     -------------------------------------------
     As above enter the Balance Sheet Items
     Also enter the previous Years closing Balance as Opening Bal for the year.
     (except Cash A/c you have to create rest of Balance Sheet items)
     
               Following are all Assets
               ------------------------ 
     
     STATE BANK OF INDIA A/C      Select Group < CASH & BANK BALANCE > 
     MUMBAI DISTRICT CO-OP BANK   Select Group < CASH & BANK BALANCE > 
     COMPUTER SYSTEMS             Select Group < FIXED ASSETS > 
     FURNITURE & FIXTURES         Select Group < FIXED ASSETS > 
     FDR NO 4250 SBI A/c          Select Group < INVESTMENTS > 
     TELEPHONE DEPOSIT            Select Group < DEPOSITS > 
     RAJESH LOAN A/C              Select Group < LOANS & ADVANCES > 
     
               Following are Liabilities
               -------------------------
                    
     Issued Share Capital         Select Group < SHARE CAPITAL > 
     Audit Fees Payable           Select Group < PROVISIONS > 
     Telephone Charges Payable    Select Group < PROVISIONS > 
     Common Ameniteis Fund        Select Group < OTHER FUNDS > 
     

    If you have made any mistake in entering the Ledger Account,
    or typed a wrong Members name, or entered a wrong Opening Balance
    you Edit it as follows, or even Delete
    
